rney, or capacity reservation is created by this check.</p></div><div className="form-actions"><button className="secondary" disabled={busy} type="submit">{busy ? 'Checking…' : 'Check serviceability'}</button><button className="primary" disabled={busy || !result?.serviceable} type="button" onClick={() => create(document.getElementById('request-form') as HTMLFormElement)}>Create collection request →</button></div></form></section>
